  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="12ad9cec-5e8d-5fe5-a57d-fbc46349f7b2" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Store a bounded document as a DOCUMENT schema/store; this AWS path remains DynamoDB.&#10;Register once per subject; request-key replay returns the original identity.&#10;Members edit only their own permitted fields; staff own branch/status changes.&#10;Commit expected-version mutation, uniqueness marker, request key and history atomically; page at most 25 results.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
